      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The jury will likely view Witness A as more credible due to his professional appearance and detailed account, suggesting a level of composure and reliability. Witness B's nervousness and casual attire might lead some jurors to perceive him as less trustworthy or less informed. Ultimately, the jury's perception will be heavily influenced by their own biases, but the descriptions lean toward favoring the more conventional presentation of Witness A.",
